In non-year tables (jaise "Q1/Q2/Q3", "Domestic vs International"), code _parse_without_header() wale fallback mechanism par jayega.

Lead Strategy:
Yeh baseline MVP ke liye bilkul acceptable hai, isko as a "Known Limitation" note kar lo.

