Score 0.657-0.668 hai — ye legitimate Apple queries (jaise "dividend" 0.670, "executive officers" 0.609) ke range ke andar hai. Matlab sirf ek simple threshold (jaise "0.6 se neeche reject karo") kaam nahi karega, kyunki Tesla ka score legitimate low-confidence Apple answers se bhi zyada hai. Ye important finding hai — threshold akela solution nahi, isko note kar lo Stage 4 ke liye.

